{:kotoba.lang.conformance/version 2
 :kotoba.lang.conformance/wbs "T1.3"
 :kotoba.lang.conformance/note
 "T1.3 dual-backend pilot expanded: control + string-ops + record + and/or/if-not/let/
  arith/nested-fn/true + string-replace + loop + T7.4 deep loop (raised :fuel) +
  if-some/option + string-byte-length + when/cond/if-let + case + bitops +
  typed-map (T4.4) + string-split-count (T4.2) + vector-i64 (T4.5) +
  vector-mut + typed-map-dissoc + quot/bit-not + pred/when-ext/if-some-string/shift +
  inc/dec + vector-sum loop + shift-right + reduce-vector + map/filter-vector +
  named-hof + thread + option-result + reduce-named + pair-list +
  string-length-concat + multi-map + list-rest + when-let-u64 +
  type-directed heterogeneous nth + nested typed destructuring.
  Full matrix still progressive."

